---
// src/components/layout/Footer.astro
// Footer Korporat Lengkap ala ISAVO dengan Legalitas, Direktori & Rekening Resmi
---

<footer class="gvf-footer" id="tentang-kami">
  <div class="gvf-container">
    <div class="gvf-footer-grid">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Kredibilitas Lembaga -->
      <div class="gvf-footer-brand">
        <img
          src="/GVF Global Village Fund Logo.png"
          alt="Global Village Fund"
          class="gvf-footer-logo"
          width="200"
          height="60"
        />
        <p class="gvf-footer-desc">
          Global Village Fund merupakan inisiatif wakaf produktif dan filantropi Islam terpadu di bawah naungan <strong>Yayasan Permata Cendekia Indonesia</strong>. Berikhtiar memperkuat ekosistem pesantren menuju kemandirian ekonomi dan dampak sosial berkelanjutan.
        </p>
        <div class="gvf-footer-legal">
          <span class="gvf-legal-pill">SK Kemenkumham RI: AHU-0005721.AH.01.04</span>
          <span class="gvf-legal-sub">Mitra Pengelolaan Wakaf, Infaq & Sedekah Terstandarisasi</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Pilar Program Wakaf -->
      <div class="gvf-footer-col">
        <h4 class="gvf-footer-heading">Pilar Program</h4>
        <ul class="gvf-footer-links">
          <li><a href="#masjid">Masjid Khairu Ummah Sugro</a></li>
          <li><a href="#skill-village">Skill Village Islamic School</a></li>
          <li><a href="#eco-pesantren">Agro-Technopark & Anggur</a></li>
          <li><a href="#simulasi">Kalkulator & Simulasi Wakaf</a></li>
          <li><a href="#transparansi">Transparansi Realisasi Dana</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Saluran Rekening Resmi -->
      <div class="gvf-footer-col" id="rekening">
        <h4 class="gvf-footer-heading">Rekening Donasi Resmi</h4>
        <div class="gvf-footer-bank-card">
          <div class="gvf-bank-header">
            <span class="gvf-bank-name">BANK SYARIAH INDONESIA (BSI)</span>
            <span class="gvf-bank-code">451</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gvf-bank-acc">7142 2637 63</div>
          <div class="gvf-bank-holder">a.n. Yayasan Permata Cendekia Indonesia</div>
          <p class="gvf-bank-note">*Semua saluran donasi diawasi secara akuntabel dan transparan.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Kontak & Alamat -->
      <div class="gvf-footer-col">
        <h4 class="gvf-footer-heading">Kantor & Lokasi Proyek</h4>
        <div class="gvf-contact-item">
          <svg class="gvf-contact-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
          </svg>
          <span>Kampus SMK Skill Village Islamic School, Desa Sukasirna, Kec. Jonggol, Kab. Bogor, Jawa Barat 16830</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gvf-contact-item" style="margin-top: 0.85rem;">
          <svg class="gvf-contact-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
          </svg>
          <a href="tel:+6281226832326" class="gvf-footer-link">+62 812-2683-2326</a>
        </div>

        <div class="gvf-contact-item" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">
          <svg class="gvf-contact-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
            <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
          </svg>
          <a href="mailto:info@globalvillagefund.org" class="gvf-footer-link">info@globalvillagefund.org</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright -->
    <div class="gvf-footer-bottom">
      <div class="gvf-copy-text">
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Global Village Fund • Yayasan Permata Cendekia Indonesia. Hak Cipta Dilindungi Undang-Undang.
      </div>
      <div class="gvf-footer-bottom-links">
        <a href="#transparansi">Laporan Transparansi</a>
        <span class="gvf-dot-sep">•</span>
        <a href="#simulasi">Simulasi Wakaf</a>
        <span class="gvf-dot-sep">•</span>
        <a href="#tentang-kami">Kebijakan Privasi</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .gvf-footer {
    background-color: var(--gvf-navy-dark);
    color: var(--gvf-text-light);
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .gvf-footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr 1.3fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .gvf-footer-logo {
    height: 48px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .gvf-footer-desc {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .gvf-footer-legal {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .gvf-legal-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    color: #e2e8f0;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--gvf-radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: monospace;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .gvf-legal-sub {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .gvf-footer-heading {
    color: var(--gvf-white);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .gvf-footer-heading::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 28px;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: var(--gvf-blue-vibrant);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .gvf-footer-links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .gvf-footer-links a,
  .gvf-footer-link {
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    transition: color var(--gvf-transition-fast);
  }

  .gvf-footer-links a:hover,
  .gvf-footer-link:hover {
    color: var(--gvf-white);
  }

  /* Bank Card */
  .gvf-footer-bank-card {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--gvf-radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .gvf-bank-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .gvf-bank-name {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #38bdf8;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .gvf-bank-code {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #64748b;
    font-family: monospace;
  }

  .gvf-bank-acc {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--gvf-white);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    user-select: all;
  }

  .gvf-bank-holder {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .gvf-bank-note {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #64748b;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .gvf-contact-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .gvf-contact-icon {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    color: var(--gvf-blue-vibrant);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* Footer Bottom */
  .gvf-footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .gvf-footer-bottom-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .gvf-footer-bottom-links a {
    color: #64748b;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--gvf-transition-fast);
  }

  .gvf-footer-bottom-links a:hover {
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .gvf-dot-sep {
    color: #475569;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .gvf-footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .gvf-footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .gvf-footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
